                "html": "<p><nobr>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{\\frac{2\\pi}{3}+2\\pi k;\\frac{4\\pi}{3}+2\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ; </nobr> <nobr>б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{8\\pi}{3}\"></span> . </nobr></p>",
